  "_file": "damned_waters/game/data/rooms/wapenhandel.json \u2014 RoomSpec for Wapenhandel de Jager (the city, district 5: the Kalverstraat): a sport-shooting and hunting shop: the gun racks behind the counter mostly empty, the glass cases of rifles chained shut, targets on the walls, boxes torn open on the floor. Whoever got here first knew what they wanted. Its front wall is the street's shopfront (\"facade\": the street builds it); its door is the street's. Every business name is made up. Single source of truth for Blender (render) and the engine (collision, cameras, things).",
